# BART STAIRS (and the goal Ollie the BART Stairs): 16th St Mission BART's southwest plaza, the
# stairs down to the station (49 steps of 14 cm, 7 m). Rolling at 5 m/s toward the top in the middle
# of the flight, a short crouch and a pop just before the edge: 1.18 s in the air, down clean on the
# 18th step (12 or more count; the full set would land at about 12 m/s, a bail). Then the rest of
# the stairs, bumped down.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 96.1 -201.1 -1.68 41.8
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 3.3327
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 3.7274
hold ollie 132..144
run 420
expect event pop within 143..147
expect event land{quality=clean,airTicks=141} within 285..289
expect event gap{id=bart_stairs,gap=BART STAIRS,points=800} within 285..289
expect event goalComplete{id=bartstairs,name=Ollie the BART Stairs} within 285..289
expect skater.pos.z < -4.3 at 287
expect no event bail
